  "title": "Aeordynamic databased of a subscale demonstrator",
  "abstract": "© 2017, American Institute of Aeronautics and Astronautics Inc, AIAA. All rights reserved.This paper reports the current status of a joint Swedish-Brazilian research project aiming at exploring sub scale flight testing. A 13% scale fighter aircraft is used as a test bench for developing methods and procedures for data acquisition. This paper will present an Aerodynamic database as a partial result of the collaborative project.",
